      "widgets_values": [
        "How the reference pictures align with the target video — Picture 1 (from Shot 1) aligns with the 0.00-second mark of the target video; Picture 2 (from Shot 1) aligns with the 6.00-second mark of the target video.\n\nintegrated_multimodal_description: [Shot 1] Live-action, cinematic, the shot begins with the high aerial view established by Picture 1: a dense town of tiled rooftops, apartment blocks, and crossing roads, with a forested hill and a temple on the left and fields in the distance, all in warm late-afternoon light. The camera dives toward a narrow side street between the tiled roofs in the lower part of the frame, pedestaling down with large amplitude at fast speed while pushing in. Rooftops, utility wires, and house walls rush past the edges of the frame as the street grows larger. Near the ground, the camera slows sharply and levels out at low height beside an old wooden shopfront with a weathered brown facade and a concrete step. A tabby-and-white cat with a red collar and a small brass bell sits on the curb in the warm sunlight. As the camera glides in and comes to rest, the cat closes its eyes, tilts its head up, and opens its mouth into a wide yawn, settling into the pose, framing, and composition established by Picture 2 at the end of the shot.\n\noverall_soundscape: A strong rush of wind accompanies the fast dive and fades as the camera nears the ground. Quiet street ambience with distant traffic takes over, the cat's bell gives a faint jingle, and a soft squeaky yawn ends the shot.\n\nnon_diegetic_music: A rising string swell at a fast tempo during the dive, dropping to a single soft plucked note as the camera comes to rest.",
